SUMMARY:Sterling-Berry House open house
DTSTAMP:20260720T113859Z
DTSTART:20260801T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, Aug. 1\, Preservation Houston members are invited
	 inside the Sterling-Berry House\, a City of Houston Landmark and National
	 Register-listed property where Montrose meets the Museum District. The bu
	ilding is vacant\, making this a rare opportunity to appreciate its archit
	ecture on its own terms.\n\nhttps://www.preservationhouston.org/calendar/2
	026/8/1/sterling-berry-open-house\n\nFrom Preservation Houston
URL:https://www.preservationhouston.org/calendar/2026/8/1/sterling-berry-op
	en-house
